@startuml job-class-at-a-glance
!include _standard-style.puml
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam componentFontSize 16
skinparam arrowFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide stereotype
title Pay for the strong model only where the job needs it

component "**Your prompt**\n“Is the benchmark finished?”" as turn <<agent>>
component "**1  Label**  (saves nothing yet)\nthe proxy's cheap model says:\nthis is a **status** job" as label <<core>>
component "**2  Check the label**  (learn)\na strong model re-labels a sample;\na class counts once 90 % of\n20+ checked labels are right" as check <<core>>
component "**3  Prove a cheaper model**  (learn)\nreplay past status turns on it,\na blind judge compares the answers:\n20+ pairs, 90 % the same answer" as prove <<core>>
file "**Team repo**  (share)\nclasses + evidence\nno prompts" as repo <<storage>>
component "**4  Route by class**  (save)\nstatus jobs -> the cheaper model,\non every member's machine;\nfix jobs stay on the strong one" as route <<core>>

turn -[#E53935,thickness=2]down-> label
label -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]right-> check
check -[#9C27B0,thickness=2]down-> prove
prove -[#FF9800,thickness=2]left-> repo : evidence
repo -[#FF9800,thickness=2]down-> route : pulled on sync
check -[#757575,thickness=1,dotted]up-> repo : prompts no class fits\n-> a new class

@enduml
